   1            /
   2            /   Clear Memory
   3            /
   4            / Starting with 011, ending with 07764, gives 07754 locations to
   5            / clear.  That's divisible only by 2, 4, and 1019.  We thus clear
   6            / memory 4 locations at a time until LOOP is cleared.
   7            *7764
   8 07764 5375 LOOP,   JMP DCA4        / 7764 Skip this until autoindex gets here
   9 07765 3001         DCA JLOOP       / 7765 Kill the loop
  10 07766 3002         DCA JLOOP+1     / 7766 Kill the loop
  11 07767 5375         JMP DCA4        / 7767 Kill just 4 more to get 7770.
  12 07770 3410         DCA I AUTO      / 7770 Spacer (not executed)
  13 07771 3410         DCA I AUTO      / 7771 Zero a location
  14 07772 3410         DCA I AUTO      / 7772 Zero a location
  15 07773 3410         DCA I AUTO      / 7773 Zero a location
  16 07774 3410         DCA I AUTO      / 7774 Zero a location
  17 07775 3410 DCA4,   DCA I AUTO      / 7775 Zero a location
  18 07776 3410         DCA I AUTO      / 7776 Zero a location
  19 07777 3410         DCA I AUTO      / 7777 Zero a location
  20            *0
  21 00000 3410         DCA I AUTO      / 0 Zero a location
  22 00001 5402 JLOOP,  JMP I .+1       / 1 Jump back
  23 00002 7764         LOOP            / 2 ...to LOOP
  24 00003 0000         0               / 3
  25 00004 0000         0               / 4
  26 00005 0000         0               / 5
  27 00006 0000         0               / 6
  28 00007 0000         0               / 7
  29 00010 0010 AUTO,   .               / Clear AUTO+1 to LOOP.
  30            /
  31            / Load Cruft before and after, to test boundary cases.
  32 00011 7402         HLT
  33            *LOOP-1
  34 07763 7402         HLT
  35            
  36            $
